Aim: To perform overloading and overriding

Algorithm:

1.Start.
2.Create a class named Mtd.
3.Define a method Fun() to print the sum of two values.
4.Create an object of class Mtd.
5.Call the Fun() method with integer values 3 and 9.
6.Call the Fun() method with floating-point values 3.3 and 9.8.
7.Call the Fun() method with two strings to concatenate them.
8.Create a base class named Base.
9.Define a method Meth1() to display the base class message.
10.Create a derived class named Derived that inherits from Base.
11.Override the Meth1() method in the derived class.
12.Use super() to call the base class method.
13.Display the derived class message.
14.Create an object of the Derived class.
15.Call the Meth1() method using the object.
16.Stop.
